            </note>
            <note corresp="#d267-f3" n="60" xml:id="d267-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d267-f4" n="61" xml:id="d267-f4-content">
                <p>Col. Percy E. Barbour, mining technician and Senior Economic Analyst; his death
                    had occurred May 4, 1943.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
